Modifications in this distribution
---------------------------------
Midscene selected source records, converted their annotations to the local
testcase format, and supplied bilingual instructions and category explanations.
Each imported testcase's index.json records its upstream dataset, record ID
and source URL. Each testcase records individual changes in reference.patch.

Excluded records and third-party materials
-----------------------------------------
The distribution uses sources with an explicit MIT or Apache-2.0 license
declared by their publishers. The exclusion policy covers records without
verified source authorization and original Mind2Web screenshots and
annotations. All 200 testcase IDs have versions in this dataset.

Depicted interfaces, logos, product names, trademarks and other third-party
content remain subject to their owners' rights. This package supplies no
additional permission or endorsement on their behalf.
WEB-v1-013 (Reddit), WEB-v1-031 (Yahoo Finance), WEB-v1-037 (JD.com) and
WEB-v1-046 (Weibo) preserve copyright notices visible in the page footers.
